# Sigstore OTA trust pins for NVS (flash-time, not compiled into the ELF).
#
# Copy to sigstore.csv, set cert_id to your workflow identity, then:
#   make nvs-sigstore PORT=/dev/cu.usbserial-XXXX
# See docs/sigstore-ota.md.
#
# Format: ESP-IDF nvs_partition_gen CSV.
# Namespace must match inkbot_esp32::sigstore_ota::NVS_NAMESPACE ("sigstore").
key,type,encoding,value
sigstore,namespace,,
oidc_iss,data,string,https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
cert_id,data,string,https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/.github/workflows/inkbot-esp32.yml@refs/heads/main
